-- Order types of well-orders: the collapse is an isomorphism onto the type,
-- equal types give isomorphic orders, and any two well-orders are comparable,
-- one being isomorphic to an initial segment of the other
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
